commit a82301b73c69afd74bea9e80e64a9fa1177f2d90

C03: «poné/poneme/ponme» count as an imperative echo in the composer (AUDIO1351)

AUDIO1239 measured «poné el volumen al 30» → final «Poné el volumen al 30.»: the level was set and verified, but the final repeated the order because the imperative-echo check only knew «pon». The voseo and clitic forms (pone, poneme, ponme, ponelo, ponlo) now count as the same echo, so the composer reports the result instead.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


